## Rules

1. All coordinates must be absolute screen positions
2. Include appropriate waits between actions
3. Verify each actions completion
4. Handle error states
5. Be precise with timing and positioning
6. No conditional logic - execute exactly as specified

## Important Notes

- Always verify cursor position before clicking
- Include necessary setup actions
- Account for system response times
- Use exact text matches
- No approximations or ranges - all values must be precise

